'''Honeymooners''' (Japanese: '''ハネムーン''' ''Honeymoon'') are a pair of [[Pokémon Trainer]]s introduced in [[Generation VI]].

In Generation VI, Honeymooners are depicted as a male and a young female {{tc|Tourist}} on their honeymoon who can challenge the player to a [[Double Battle]].

In [[Generation VII]], the pair is formed by a male and a female {{tc|Sightseer}}. Like Sightseers, Honeymooners in [[Alola]] use the [[Kanto]]nian variants of Pokémon that have [[Alolan form]]s.

