[[File:Honeymooners Hoppip Adventures.png|thumb|200px|Honeymooners in Pokémon Adventures]]
A pair of Honeymooners appeared in ''[[PS554|Kangaskhan...Kangascan't]]'' and ''[[PS558|What Does Charmander Do When It Dozes]]'', where they were looking at maps while in [[Santalune City]] and [[Lumiose City]].

In ''[[PS592|Zygarde Agitated]]'', a pair of Honeymooners were briefly shown at the [[Ambrette Town|Ambrette Aquarium]].

